{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Panic Files: Buried Sanity is a first-person psychological horror game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just started your new job at the local mine when the worst happened. The mine caved in, panic ensued, you got hit in the head by a falling rock and were left behind. As you wake up alone in the abandoned shaft your only option is to try finding your way out alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive or is your fate already sealed? Travel further into the mine filled with poisonous gas that makes you lose your mind the deeper you go and find out why the miners were afraid of the lower levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains flashing lights, hallucinations and a heavy atmosphere. Player discretion is advised.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4012730?t=1758212415","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4012730?t=1758212415","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012730/9965bc095998bbaf27aa09bab7f10a86bf569f56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758212415","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012730/9965bc095998bbaf27aa09bab7f10a86bf569f56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758212415","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains scary scenes that may seem disturbing to some players."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Panic Files: Buried Sanity is a first-person psychological horror game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just started your new job at the local mine when the worst happened. The mine caved in, panic ensued, you got hit in the head by 